{"row_id": "q037", "objective": "IPS-06061 in vivo single-agent monotherapy tumour growth inhibition TGI tumour regression tumour shrinkage in KRAS G12D Mutant Pancreatic Ductal Adenocarcinoma animal models", "anchors": ["IPS-06061"], "mode": "batch", "case_id": "q037-batch", "query": ["IPS-06061 AsPC-1 xenograft tumour regression", "IPS-06061 30 mg/kg TGI AsPC-1", "IPS-06061 day 28 tumour volume AsPC-1", "IPS-06061 tumour shrinkage pancreatic cancer xenograft"], "repeat": 0, "provider": "perplexity", "request": {"query": ["IPS-06061 AsPC-1 xenograft tumour regression", "IPS-06061 30 mg/kg TGI AsPC-1", "IPS-06061 day 28 tumour volume AsPC-1", "IPS-06061 tumour shrinkage pancreatic cancer xenograft"], "search_type": "web", "max_results": 10}, "ok": true, "status": 200, "error": null, "attempts": 1, "latency_ms": 849.4, "n_results": 10, "results": [{"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "IPS-07004 - 炎症，哮喘，帕金森病_专利 - 新药情报库 - 智慧芽", "url": "https://synapse.zhihuiya.com/drug/074cef8ac787445e84e042b3528d26df", "domain": "synapse.zhihuiya.com", "snippet": "IPS-06061选择性降解KRAS G12D（专利中申明也可以降解G12V，但缺乏数据），DC50 = 230 nM，Dmax > 90%。\n同时对KRAS WT具有选择性。体内药效尚可。\n...\nIPS-06061 显示 AsPC-1 胰腺癌细胞中 KRAS G12D 的降解呈时间依赖性，KRAS G12D 的 DC50 <500 nM 和 Dmax >90%，而对 Caco-2 细胞中 KRAS WT 的降解没有影响。\n这些数据表明，由于 IPS -06061 诱导的蛋白质泛素化，KRAS GI2D 被成功降解。\nIPS-06061的体内药效 采用植入AsPC-1胰腺癌细胞的异种移植小鼠模型，每周两次口服IPS-06061，持续28天。\n与空白对照相比，高剂量(80mpk)治疗组中的平均肿瘤生长显着减少（TGI接近100%），且显着降低了肿瘤重量。此外，通过测量体重、食物摄入量、全血细胞计数和生化血液化学来评估毒性，IPS-06061组未观察到明显变化。\n总而言之，这些数据表明 IPS-06061 通过 CRBN-KRAS G12D-IPS-06061 三元复合物形成诱导 KRAS G12D 泛素化而显示出良好的抗癌活性。\n...\n当然目前看来IPS-06061的体内外药效并不出色（DC50活性一般，TGI接近100%，尚无法达到肿瘤消退），且成药性应该也有较大提升空间。基于这一结构进行进一步的成药性优化，可能会发现药效更为出色的G12D分子胶降解剂。", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-02"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "IPS-06061, a novel TPD molecular glue degrader targeting ...", "url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/Abstract-384:-IPS-06061,-a-novel-TPD-molecular-glue-Kang-Seo/4f2bcf78c924979bc6307109217d45ba8c3f04e4", "domain": "semanticscholar.org", "snippet": "This work has discovered a novel KRAS G12D-degrading Molecular Glue using IPS's cutting-edge ProGlu AI-based drug discovery platform and PPIExplorer, an IPS-Chip based Proteomics technology and confirmed a strong anti-tumor efficacy using a xenograft animal model.", "date": "2025-04-21", "last_updated": "2026-03-20"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "IPS-06061, a novel orally active TPD molecular glue degrader targeting… | Gagan Kukreja | 10 comments", "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/kukreja3_ips-06061-a-novel-orally-active-tpd-molecular-activity-7323060772941504513-JGc2", "domain": "linkedin.com", "snippet": "IPS-06061, a novel orally active TPD molecular glue degrader targeting KRAS G12D shows strong anti-tumor efficacy using a xenograft animal model Discovered using IPS's cutting-edge ProGlu AI-based drug discovery platform that accurately predicts PPI between E3 ligase and KRAS G12D through MD simulation, enabling de novo design of MG degraders and PPIExplorer, an IPS-Chip based Proteomics technology https://lnkd.in/gyuut7Re https://lnkd.in/g2PZ_vD6", "date": "2025-04-29", "last_updated": "2025-05-01"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "JavaScript is required...", "url": "https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/bioassay/511742", "domain": "pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov", "snippet": "Please enable Javascript in order to use PubChem website.\n...\nBefore sharing sensitive information, make sure you’re on a federal government site.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-06-27"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "CONTENTdm", "url": "https://ojd.contentdm.oclc.org/digital/api/collection/p17027coll5/id/41166/download", "domain": "ojd.contentdm.oclc.org", "snippet": "To experience full interactivity, please enable Javascript in your browser.\n...\nSOLL Document Collections", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-06-25"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "Cloudflare", "url": "ht